WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:00.990
Jupiter.

00:01.690 --> 00:03.725
Brighter than any star, and white.

00:04.175 --> 00:09.716
Hold binoculars still and you will see up to four small points in a line beside it.

00:10.166 --> 00:16.351
They are its largest moons, the ones Galileo found, and they change places from night to night.
